{"name": "Scars of Honor", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"706\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/a6e54fa49eb4e5f77af39fef3ba6d5fd.avif?t=1786082993\" width=\"1232\"/></span>Set on the war-torn continent of Aragon, two alliances - the disciplined Sacred Order and the relentless Domination - battle for survival as an ancient Ice Dragon stirs in the frozen North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your faction, race, and class, then build your hero through a modern MMO combat system, evolving talents, personal Scars, meaningful crafting, and endlessly replayable Evershifting Dungeons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES:<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/50c227815b21c6113549691218e07933.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/50c227815b21c6113549691218e07933.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/50c227815b21c6113549691218e07933.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast, modern MMO combat that rewards positioning, timing, and decision-making. Master active abilities, react to enemy patterns, and outplay your opponents rather than relying on rotations alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/959de31de0fab7d86c6b01b187f655a5.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/959de31de0fab7d86c6b01b187f655a5.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/959de31de0fab7d86c6b01b187f655a5.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape your character with over 240 talents per class and permanent Scars that fundamentally alter your abilities and playstyle. Every choice matters, creating builds that feel personal, powerful, and distinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/d085d277f93d0d53f504ac5344c668a2.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/d085d277f93d0d53f504ac5344c668a2.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/d085d277f93d0d53f504ac5344c668a2.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two dungeon runs are the same. Dynamic layouts, shifting encounters, and changing modifiers ensure each run offers new challenges, strategies, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/558e6c91e03b702ddf044fbd0c44df9e.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/558e6c91e03b702ddf044fbd0c44df9e.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/558e6c91e03b702ddf044fbd0c44df9e.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from unique races and unconventional classes, each grounded in the world\u2019s lore and identity. Visual design, abilities, and narrative themes reinforce meaningful faction and character choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/ac8bdaa9e0beb11e57def82467f08bc2.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/ac8bdaa9e0beb11e57def82467f08bc2.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/ac8bdaa9e0beb11e57def82467f08bc2.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skill in Arenas and 5v5 Battlegrounds with equalized gear. Victory is determined by teamwork, strategy, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/940b2ef7213827315335e037f6ec25fd.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/940b2ef7213827315335e037f6ec25fd.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/940b2ef7213827315335e037f6ec25fd.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft, upgrade, and customize gear to complement your build and preferred playstyle. Progression supports experimentation, letting you refine your character as you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/e5cb828dfa8aa4308193c1492e994710.poster.avif?t=1786082993\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/e5cb828dfa8aa4308193c1492e994710.webm?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/extras/e5cb828dfa8aa4308193c1492e994710.mp4?t=1786082993\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fair monetization model focused on cosmetics and convenience only. Power is earned through gameplay, not purchases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scars of Honor</strong> is built for players who want freedom, challenge, and long-term character identity in a living MMORPG world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Scars of Honor is a free-to-play fantasy MMORPG where player choice, skill-based combat, and meaningful progression shape your legend.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253010/2c606816edb55983ecc15bae35a721a88a22a489/header.jpg?t=1786082993", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["MMORPG", "Free to Play", "PvP", "Exploration", "PvE", "Character Customization"], "developers": "Beast Burst Entertainment", "publishers": "Beast Burst Entertainment", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4253010", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 March 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/gs3TJLh2_6Q", "first_seen": 1773097200.0, "review_rank": 1013}